{% comment %}
Findings Hub Footer Section
Footer for findings directory with navigation CTAs
{% endcomment %}

<section class="findings-footer">
  <div class="findings-footer__container">

    <div class="findings-footer__section">
      <h2 class="findings-footer__title">How Findings Drive the Observatory</h2>
      <p class="findings-footer__description">
        Each published finding is a validated insight that informs intervention logic. Findings are the foundation. They answer "what is true?" Dossiers answer "what do we do about it?" Transitions connect them both.
      </p>
      <p class="findings-footer__description">
        Browse findings by transition, explore the research articles that support them, and discover the intervention protocols built from them.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="findings-footer__section">
      <h2 class="findings-footer__title">Explore the Observatory</h2>
      
      <div class="findings-footer__navigation">
        
        <a href="/" class="findings-footer__nav-card">
          <h3 class="findings-footer__nav-title">Observatory Home</h3>
          <p class="findings-footer__nav-description">
            Browse all transitions, featured findings, and discover the research archives.
          </p>
          <span class="findings-footer__nav-link">Explore Home →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/sleep-to-wakefulness" class="findings-footer__nav-card">
          <h3 class="findings-footer__nav-title">Sleep → Wakefulness</h3>
          <p class="findings-footer__nav-description">
            The morning transition. Featured findings, research articles, and intervention protocols.
          </p>
          <span class="findings-footer__nav-link">View Transition →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/work-to-recovery" class="findings-footer__nav-card">
          <h3 class="findings-footer__nav-title">Work → Recovery</h3>
          <p class="findings-footer__nav-description">
            The evening transition. From productivity to parasympathetic dominance.
          </p>
          <span class="findings-footer__nav-link">View Transition →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/stimulation-to-restoration" class="findings-footer__nav-card">
          <h3 class="findings-footer__nav-title">Stimulation → Restoration</h3>
          <p class="findings-footer__nav-description">
            The micro-transition. Managing stimulation load throughout the day.
          </p>
          <span class="findings-footer__nav-link">View Transition →</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="findings-footer__section findings-footer__section--cta">
      <h3 class="findings-footer__cta-title">Want to understand the methodology?</h3>
      <a href="/pages/the-method" class="findings-footer__cta-link">
        Read about how the Observatory works →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .findings-footer {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    background: #faf7f2;
  }

  .findings-footer__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .findings-footer__section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .findings-footer__section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .findings-footer__title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .findings-footer__description {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .findings-footer__description:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .findings-footer__navigation {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-card:hover {
    background: #f5f2ed;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-description {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #1a1a18;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .findings-footer__nav-card:hover .findings-footer__nav-link {
    color: #666;
  }

  .findings-footer__section--cta {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .findings-footer__cta-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .findings-footer__cta-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: #1a1a18;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .findings-footer__cta-link:hover {
    background: #333;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .findings-footer {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .findings-footer__title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .findings-footer__description {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .findings-footer__navigation {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .findings-footer__section--cta {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .findings-footer__cta-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Findings Hub Footer",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}